<para>Common interface for managed, format and system tables. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Create operators with NewScan/NewRead/NewWrite/NewCommit; unsupported operations return errors. Operators use this table&apos;s type, path, schema and file system, with context execution settings. </para>
